---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - AI Resume Advisor">
  <Header />

  <main class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-caption">Last Updated: November 28, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-body">
        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            AI Resume Advisor LLC ("we," "our," or "company") respects and protects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect your personal information. By using our services, you agree to the practices described in this policy.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our principal office address is: 30 N Gould St Ste N Sheridan, WY 82801.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Name, email address, and password provided when creating an account.</li>
            <li>
              <strong>Resume Content:</strong> Information you create, upload, or import into our platform, including:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
                <li>Resume text and formatting</li>
                <li>Job descriptions you analyze</li>
                <li>LinkedIn profile data (if imported)</li>
                <li>Alignment scores and assessment results</li>
                <li>Course and certification selections in the simulator</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Career-related Information:</strong> Job preferences, target positions, expected salary, etc.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage Information:</strong> How you use our services, including pages visited, features used, number of documents created, etc.</li>
            <li><strong>Device and Technical Information:</strong> Device type, operating system, browser type, IP address, language preferences, etc.</li>
            <li><strong>Communication Content:</strong> Your communications with our customer support team.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> If you use paid services, we may collect necessary payment information (usually processed by secure third-party payment processors).</li>
            <li><strong>Third-party Account Information:</strong> If you choose to log in through a third-party account (e.g., Google or LinkedIn), we may receive certain information provided by these platforms.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We only collect information necessary to provide our services and are committed to protecting your privacy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the collected information to:</p>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Provide and improve our services</li>
            <li>Personalize your experience</li>
            <li>Conduct analysis and research</li>
            <li>Communicate with you</li>
            <li>Protect our legitimate interests</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">4. Information Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
          <p>We value your privacy and strictly limit the sharing of your information. We may share your information in the following circumstances:</p>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>With your explicit consent:</strong> We will only share your resume information or other personal data with potential employers, recruiters, or other third parties with your explicit consent. You can withdraw this consent at any time.</li>
            <li><strong>Service providers:</strong> We may share necessary information with third-party service providers who help us deliver our services (e.g., cloud storage providers, payment processors). These service providers are per our instructions and are contractually bound to protect your privacy.</li>
            <li><strong>Legal requirements:</strong> We may need to disclose your information if required by law or to protect our legitimate interests.</li>
            <li><strong>Business transfers:</strong> In the event of a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, your information may be transferred as part of the assets. We will ensure that the receiving party continues to protect your information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Please note that we will not sell, rent, or share your personal information or resume data with any third party for marketing purposes unless we obtain your explicit permission.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
          <p>
            We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to improve your user experience, analyze website usage, and provide personalized services. Cookies are small text files stored on your device to remember your preferences and other information.
          </p>
          <p>We use the following types of cookies:</p>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> These cookies are necessary for basic website functionality, such as keeping you logged in.</li>
            <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> These cookies help us understand how our website is used, allowing us to improve user experience. We use third-party analytics tools like Google Analytics.</li>
            <li><strong>Functional cookies:</strong> These cookies allow the website to remember your choices (such as language preferences) to provide a more personalized experience.</li>
            <li><strong>Advertising cookies:</strong> We may use these cookies to provide ads relevant to your interests.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">You can control cookies through:</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Browser settings:</strong> Most web browsers allow you to control cookies. You can set your browser to refuse all cookies or to only refuse third-party cookies.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Opt-out:</strong> For analytics cookies, you can opt out of Google Analytics by visiting <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-hover">https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Do Not Track:</strong> Our website responds to "Do Not Track" signals. You can enable this in your browser settings.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Please note that disabling certain cookies may affect website functionality and your user experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            We may also use web beacons, pixel tags, and other similar technologies. These are small graphic files that help us analyze user behavior and measure the success of marketing campaigns.
          </p>
          <p>
            By continuing to use our website, you consent to our use of cookies and other tracking technologies. If you have any questions or need more information, please contact us.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>According to applicable data protection laws, you may have the following rights:</p>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Access your personal information</li>
            <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
            <li>Delete your information</li>
            <li>Object to or restrict processing</li>
            <li>Data portability</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            To exercise these rights, please email <a href="mailto:wenhao@airesumeadvisor.com" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-hover">wenhao@airesumeadvisor.com</a>. We will respond to your request within 30 days. In some cases, we may need to verify your identity or request additional information to process your request.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">7. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this Privacy Policy or to comply with legal requirements. Our data retention principles are as follows:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Account information and resume data:</strong> Retained while your account is active. If your account becomes inactive or you unsubscribe from our services, we may retain your data for a reasonable period to allow for account reactivation or service restoration. However, once you explicitly request data deletion, we will process your request promptly.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> We retain usage data for analytical purposes, with the retention period depending on the nature of the data and our business needs. Typically, this data is stored in aggregate or anonymized form.</li>
            <li><strong>Communication records:</strong> We retain communication records for a reasonable period to provide ongoing customer support and improve our services.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            When information is no longer needed, we will take appropriate measures to securely delete or anonymize it. If you wish to learn about retention periods for specific types of data or request deletion of your data, please contact our customer support team.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are committed to balancing our business needs for data retention with our responsibility to protect user privacy. We regularly review and update our data retention practices to ensure they comply with applicable laws and regulatory requirements.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">8. Security Measures</h2>
          <p>We highly value your data security and employ multi-layered security measures to protect your personal information:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> All data transmissions use SSL/TLS encryption.</li>
            <li><strong>Access control:</strong> Strict employee access controls and authentication mechanisms.</li>
            <li><strong>Data backup:</strong> Regular data backups and disaster recovery plans.</li>
            <li><strong>Security audits:</strong> Regular security audits and vulnerability assessments.</li>
            <li><strong>Employee training:</strong> Regular employee training on data security and privacy protection.</li>
            <li><strong>Physical security:</strong> Strict physical security measures at data centers.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            While we take these precautions, please remember that no security system is entirely impenetrable. If you discover any security issues, please contact us immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">9. Age Restriction</h2>
          <p>
            Our services are intended for users 18 years of age and older. If we become aware that we have collected personal information from users under 18, we will take steps to promptly delete that information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">10. Policy Updates</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated version on our website and notify you of any significant changes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">11. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
          <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-1 mt-4">
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:wenhao@airesumeadvisor.com" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-hover">wenhao@airesumeadvisor.com</a></li>
            <li><strong>Address:</strong> 30 N Gould St Ste N Sheridan, WY 82801</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <div class="mt-12 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-caption">
            By using our services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose h2 {
    @apply mt-8 mb-4;
  }
  .prose p {
    @apply mb-4;
  }
  .prose ul {
    @apply mb-4;
  }
</style>
